    Inferred The extra ICT tester does not lift system output in this simulation: ICT testers utilization fell from 58.8% to 53.5% while shipped output was 463.4 boards versus 463.6 boards, so the added capacity is largely idle and the system constraint lies elsewhere, likely the SMT front end.
